#: rc.cpp:173
msgid ""
"<p>Select the audio output method desired.  If you select <b>GStreamer</b>, "
"you must also select a <b>Sink</b>.</p><p><em>Note</em>:  You must have "
"GStreamer >= 0.87 to use GStreamer.</p>"
